elcome to \"MMA Cage Conquest,\" where MMA meets VR in a heart-pounding fusion of combat and immersion. Step into authentic arenas where every fight is a thrilling test of skill, strategy, and determination.\n\nIn \"MMA Cage Conquest,\" you're not just a spectator\u2014you're the star. Whether you're a seasoned veteran or a fresh-faced newcomer, the Champion's Journey beckons, offering challenges, triumphs, and unforgettable moments.\n\nTrain diligently across various fighting styles to outmaneuver your opponents. Then, test your mettle in high-stakes online championships, from intense one-on-one battles to team-based showdowns.\n\nClimb the ranks to unlock new arenas and customize your fighter with a vast array of equipment. Feel every punch, kick, and submission hold with cutting-edge VR technology, immersing you in the raw thrill of combat.\n\nAre you ready to embark on the ultimate conquest, prove yourself as the undisputed champion of \"MMA Cage Conquest,\" and etch your name among the legends of the sport? The choice is yours.", "short_description": "Step into the immersive world of Cage Conquest, where dynamic combat takes center stage in authentic arenas. Embark on the Champion's Journey, honing your skills through strategic training to conquer online championships. Experience the thrill of victory in VR."}]}, "developer_name": "5thScape", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://5thscape.com/cageconquest-privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "5thScape", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://5thscape.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7240758756033910"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 19, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2106046029997042"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4511754455728589"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1006797941941001"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2388355444990298"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "983331861002768"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1731660111166782"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2043767649850653"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1950644855838118"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1413742127086136"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "876844661666345"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1546077933074786"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "777357641659460"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1305486730961720"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1076554010643742"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1524329811858644"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "962127012727829"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "956604083002173"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1100630577838818"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "755240933347438"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "983331861002768"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792774800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2106046029997042"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27490306450652509", "version": "46"}, "id": "825395256071998", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7240758719367247", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27490306450652509"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "825395256071998"}]}, "change_log": "Step Into the Cage: New MMA Update is LIVE! \n\nWe have just rolled out a heavy-hitting update for the game, bringing smarter opponents, better match pacing, and a smoother overall experience!\n\nHere is what is new in this patch:\n\nSmarter AI Opponents: We have upgraded the Singleplayer AI to give you a more realistic, tactical, and challenging fight. Keep your guard up!\n\nNew Round System: Pacing is everything. We have officially introduced a structured round system for both Singleplayer and Multiplayer PvP matches to deliver a true MMA experience.\n\nActive Global Lobby: We have added improvements to the global lobby to keep the environment lively and active while you gear up for your next bout.\n\nNew Kick Timeout UI: We have implemented a brand-new UI for kick timeouts, giving you clearer visual feedback during the action.\n\nFitness Mode Fixes: We have squashed the bugs in Fitness Mode so your workout sessions are now smoother and uninterrupted.\n\nOverall Optimization: We have packed in various bug fixes, performance improvements, and under-the-hood optimizations to ensure the gameplay runs flawlessly.\n\nStep back into the octagon, test your skills against the new AI, and let us know what you think.", "created_date": 1786342652, "id": "27490306450652509", "version": "46", "version_code": 46, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27490300823986405"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7240758719367247", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27490306450652509"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_r